   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Shenandoah Breakdown**: back after 155 archived shows (1045 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Sunny Side Of The Mountain**: back after 67 archived shows (703 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **A Pick And Three Dollars**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Home Sweet Home**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Farewell Blues**: back after 70 archived shows (710 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **My Reflection**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Mountain Dew**: back after 108 archived shows (864 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Lay Down My Old Guitar**: back after 127 archived shows (915 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-10-12** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 106 min [1]\n- **billystrings2021-10-12.mbho**: source not stated; 22 songs; 109 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mics were placed front of board, stage left of center, seven feet high and about 35 feet from the stage [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-10-12**: taped by Brain; transferred by Brain; source: Schoeps CMC6/MK4 & soundboard> Sound Devices MixPre-6 [1]\n- **billystrings2021-10-12.mbho**: taped by Rob O'Brien; transferred by Rob O'Brien; source: MBHO KA500 HN(DINa) > MBP 603 A > Sound Devices MixPre-6 II(24/96) [2]",
